{"articleNo":"2278","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2278&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★ 2009학년도 2학기 학부 휴·복학 신청 안내 ★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.02","hit":"23318","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n<table width=\"578\" border=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"572\">\n            <p style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>★ 휴</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>·</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>복학 신청 안내 ★</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong> </strong></font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2009학년도 2학기 휴·복학신청을 인터넷으로 접수받</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">습니다. 안내문에&nbsp;따라 원스톱서비스에서 신청하시기 바라며, </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">휴·복학&nbsp; 확정</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 여</font></span><span st