\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"44\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2009. 8. 3(월) 10 : 00 ~ 8. 14(금) 23 : 59까지</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">※ 위 기간 경과 후에는 학사서비스센터(학생회관 101호)로 직접 방문 신청하여야 함.</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"29\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">신청 방법</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"29\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">홈페이지→원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→휴학신청접수</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"72\" rowspan=\"2\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">제출 서류</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"58\" height=\"72\" rowspan=\"2\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">없음</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"364\" height=\"26\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">입영통지서 사본 or 군복무확인서 사본</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">4주이상 진단서</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"364\" height=\"46\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 학</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">번, 연락처, 복무개월수를 기재하여 휴학신청 당일</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (24시까지) 제출.</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">서류 미제출자는 3일후 휴학신청 자동 취소됨.</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"46\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"102\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">제출 장소</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"102\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 학사관리팀 or 팩스(054-478-7069)</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2. 팩스로 제출한 학생 중 신청 익일 1시 이후 처리가 되어 있지 않은 학생은 팩스&nbsp;도착여부를 반드시 확인 바람(☎ 054-478-7066)</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">*군입대 휴학 후, 귀향조치 및 입영 거부된 학</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">생은&nbsp;즉시 학사관리팀으로 반드시 연락</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">바람.</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"44\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">확정 여부</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"44\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 확정 : 휴학 신청 후(서류 제출 후) 다음날 오후 1시 이후</font></span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">확인</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"> : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→학적변동내역</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span>\n            <p></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;※ 군입대 휴학을 원하나 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">입영통지서가 아직 나오지 않은 학생</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">은 우선 일반휴학을 신청하고</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FA